                                "sense_id": "05e32c44-e8b7-387a-b006-8c351fa9d23d",
                                "text": "Before man baked bread, he made bulgur by parboiling wheat and spreading it out in the sun to dry. […] Every household in the Near East prepared a year's store of bulgur in the fall after the wheat harvest."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
